The challenge was to quickly typeset a whole book's worth of content 
in a very small font on one large (\acro{DIN A0}) sheet. For obvious legibility
reasons, it had to be set a)~in a typeface suitable for the task, and 
b)~in many columns, preferably more than the 
20~columns the \texttt{multicol} package currently provides. A usable 
result was obtained using the \texttt{flowfram} package. 
